# Avatar Aang: "Then if you've done all four this turn, transform Avatar Aang" counts the controller's own bends of this turn,
# and each of the four kinds. On turn 5 Bot1 waterbends (Flexible Waterbender's {3}, CR 701.67c). On turn 7 Bot2 waterbends with its
# own Flexible Waterbender, and Bot1 earthbends (Badgermole Cub, CR 701.66b), airbends (Airbending Lesson on Bot2's Mox Jet, CR
# 701.65b) and firebends (Aang's firebending 2, CR 702.189b): Bot1's waterbend was on an earlier turn and this turn's was Bot2's,
# so Aang stays Avatar Aang and deals 4. On turn 9 Bot1 airbends Bot2's Mox Pearl, waterbends and firebends, but does not
# earthbend: still Avatar Aang, 4 more. Every one of Bot1's bends draws a card; Bot2's does not.

